# Line endings.
#
# The repository is developed on Windows and built on Linux. A shell script
# checked out with CRLF fails inside a container as `exec format error` or
# `/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter` -- a confusing failure whose cause is invisible
# in a diff. These files are always LF, on every platform.
*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.dockerfile    text eol=lf
docker-entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
*.conf          text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
